   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## A29 (b): SDR -> HDR + Open Regenerate 4K gain-map join\n\nTop: the (a) path - draft-size linear HDR (1344x768).\nBottom: the Suite's **Open Regenerate STD** at **4k** on the same SDR frames (FL2VA + Open Regen LoRA, Euler, 3 sigmas,\nFast VAE Decode, Finish).\n**H3 HDR Gain Map Join**: gain = HDR / downscaled linear Regenerate, guided-upsampled on the 4K luma -> 4K linear HDR\n-> **Save EXR Sequence** (4K) + preview. The draft-size EXR is saved too.\nBoth paths must keep the same frames (frame_count from Prepare Draft feeds both trims)."
   ]
  }
